  m_text: "After climbing the stairs you find yourself in a hallway with high ceilings
    and cobwebs scattered through. \n\nTo your right you see a large archway, leading
    through to what appears to be a bridge.\n\nOn your left, a very small door you
    can probably just squeeze through."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
