  m_text: "As you flip through the pages you find yourself at the end of the book
    where one incantation has caught your eye.\n\n\u201CTo access the power of the
    hall, simply read this spell,\u201D \n\nit said, bold and ominous.\nYou didn\u2019t
    exactly pause to consider the possible consequences.\n\nYou read the spell aloud,
    the pages flare, the room begins to tremble and a blinding light envelops you!"
