  m_text: "You leap off the edge of the cliff into the ravine and suddenly hit solid
    ground? an invisible, hidden bridge!\n\n\"I dont know if youre incredibly perceptive
    or incredibly stupid, but i admire it all the same\" the voice says, honestly.
    \n\nYou make it safely to the other side."
